1
00:00:00,670 --> 00:00:01,710
Thanks for the meal.

2
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:04,090
It was delicious today, too.

3
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:08,090
Alright, let's practice our lines.

4
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:11,430
Wait, um...

5
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:13,640
The audition is the week after next.

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,350
We don't have much time.

7
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:16,810
Let's get started.

8
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:19,890
Oh, okay.

9
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,860
Give me excess of it,

10
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:25,900
That, surfeiting,
the appetite may sicken,

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,360
- And so die.
- Um, actually...

12
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,240
What's wrong?

13
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:34,270
Is it really okay to spend
all this time on just me?

14
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,620
Huh?

15
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,870
What do you mean?

16
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,290
Hey, shouldn't you be
a bit more assertive?

17
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:44,920
You need to act like
you're going to sweep me off my feet.

18
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:47,170
Even more assertive?

19
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:50,470
Yes, you're not even close.

20
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,800
I saw you the other day.

21
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,720
Kaede-san was practicing hard with you.

22
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,430
Oh, yeah.

23
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:00,520
There are still some parts I'm unsure about.

24
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:03,100
Even though both of you

25
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:04,610
need to practice too,

26
00:01:04,610 --> 00:01:06,820
you're spending all your time on me.

27
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:08,530
It's fine.

28
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:10,950
- But...
- Don't worry about it.

29
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:13,280
Is Kaede-san really okay with this?

30
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,450
She's fine with it.

31
00:01:16,990 --> 00:01:19,000
You know,

32
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,540
right now,

33
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:22,460
getting to act with a diamond
in the rough like you

34
00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:25,540
makes me incredibly excited.

35
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:28,760
I've never felt
such an exciting rush before.

36
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:31,340
I want you to use that brilliance of yours

37
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:34,680
to light up everyone.

38
00:01:37,470 --> 00:01:40,020
I am known as the shopkeeper.

39
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:42,730
I am known as the shopkeeper.

40
00:01:42,730 --> 00:01:46,150
Among those of you present,
some may already know me.

41
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:47,440
Among those of you present,

42
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,730
some may already know me.

43
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:57,910
(I want to live up to Haru senpai's expectations!)

44
00:01:57,910 --> 00:02:00,450
I am Viola.

45
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:02,120
If I were a woman,

46
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,870
I would love you deeply,

47
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:05,710
and fall hopelessly in love with you.
